    "identifier": "earth-release-unphased-rock",
    "description": "<p>You mark a single stone you are holding with chakra as you bind a piece of yourself to it for the duration. Select two Skill proficiencies or 1 Save Proficiency. This stone becomes imbued with that knowledge and experience for the duration.</p>\n<p>A creature who is holding this stone with one hand gains these proficiencies for the duration. While holding this stone they cannot make hand seals or use Chakra seals with the same hand holding the stone.</p>",
